 "remarks": "PETS WELCOME! HEAT, WATER, SNOW REMOVAL, AND WASHER/DRYER GAS INCLUDED IN RENT! Enjoy low-maintenance living in an updated Byram apartment featuring a newly renovated kitchen and bathroom, brand-new in-unit W/D, and large picture frame windows for sunset views. The updated modern eclectic / contemporary-retro kitchen features new granite countertops and a chic metal backsplash, white glossy cabinetry, and brand new appliances. The renovated bathroom also has granite countertops and a brand new vanity and shower, plus a washer and dryer! Located near recently renovated Byram Park and downtown Port Chester, with easy access to bartaco, Colony Grill, Kneaded Bread, Whole Foods, Costco, and The Waterfront at Port Chester. Multiple bus stops and convenient access to I-95 make getting around easy. NO OFF-STREET PARKING PROVIDED, but two nearby municipal parking lots offer additional parking options, along with ample on-street parking. Tenant pays electricity and stove gas. Pets welcome!",
